ointer;">清缓存</button>\n      </div>\n      <div id="foxmem-vector-stats" style="font-size:11px;color:#706058;line-height:1.6;margin-top:8px;">${o.vectorMemory?.enabled ? "已开启，保存配置后生效" : "当前关闭"}</div>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    \x3c!-- ====== 第三层：🎯 Rerank 精排 ====== --\x3e\n    <details style="background:rgba(232,120,74,0.035);border:1px solid rgba(232,120,74,0.15);border-radius:12px;margin-top:12px;">\n      <summary style="cursor:pointer;padding:14px 16px;font-weight:600;color:#f0a070;font-size:14px;user-select:none;">🎯 Rerank 精排</summary>\n      <div style="padding:0 16px 16px;">\n      <div style="font-size:11px;color:#90756a;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:10px;">向量召回捞出的 Top N 候选送入交叉编码器（cross-encoder），按「查询+信息句」联合打分精排，命中时取代向量余弦分参与加权融合。embedding 负责「找得到」，rerank 负责「排得准」：语义相近但无关的记忆会被压下去，未了结伏笔/承诺类召回更稳。仅在「向量语义召回」开启时生效；接口失败自动回退纯向量排序，不阻塞发送。支持 OpenAI 兼容 <code>/rerank</code>（硅基流动 BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3、Jina、Xinference 等）；本地 Ollama 填 <code>http://localhost:11434/api</code>（自动拼接 /rerank，本地地址允许 HTTP）。</div>\n      <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:8px;color:#ffd8b8;font-size:12px;">\n        <span>启用 Rerank 精排</span>\n        <input id="foxmem-rerank-enabled" type="checkbox" ${o.rerank?.enabled ? "checked" : ""}>\n      </label>\n      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px 12px;margin-bottom:8px;">\n        <div><label style="font-size:11px;color:#706058;">连接方式</label><select id="foxmem-rerank-mode" style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(232,120,74,.15);border-radius:6px;color:#e8ddd4;padding:6px 8px;"><option value="custom" ${!o.rerank?.proxyPreset ? "selected" : ""}>直接配置</option><option value="proxy" ${o.rerank?.proxyPreset ? "selected" : ""}>借用酒馆代理预设</option></select></div>\n        <div id="foxmem-rerank-proxy-wrap" style="display:${o.rerank?.proxyPreset ? "block" : "none"};"><label style="font-size:11px;color:#706058;">代理预设</label><select id="foxmem-rerank-proxy-preset" style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(232,120,74,.15);border-radius:6px;color:#e8ddd4;padding:6px 8px;">${m}</select></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px 12px;">\n        <div id="foxmem-rerank-endpoint-wrap" style="display:${o.rerank?.proxyPreset ? "none" : "block"};"><label style="font-size:11px;color:#706058;">Rerank API 地址</label><input id="foxmem-rerank-endpoint" type="text" placeholder="https://api.siliconflow.cn/v1" value="${escapeHtml(o.rerank?.endpoint || "")}" style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(232,120,74,.15);border-radius:6px;color:#e8ddd4;padding:6px 8px;"></div>\n        <div id="foxmem-rerank-key-wrap" style="display:${o.rerank?.proxyPreset ? "none" : "block"};"><label style="font-size:11px;color:#706058;">API Key</label><input id="foxmem-rerank-key" type="password" value="${escapeHtml(o.rerank?.apiKey || "")}" style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(232,120,74,.15);border-radius:6px;color:#e8ddd4;padding:6px 8px;"></div>\n        <div><label style="font-size:11px;color:#706058;">Rerank 模型</label><div style="display:flex;gap:6px;"><input id="foxmem-rerank-model" type="text" placeholder="BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3" value="${escapeHtml(o.rerank?.model || "")}" style="flex:1;min-width:0;box-sizing:border-box;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(232,120,74,.15);border-radius:6px;color:#e8ddd4;padding:6px 8px;"><button id="foxmem-rerank-fetch-models" type="button" style="padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid rgba(232,120,74,.2);border-radius:6px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);color:#a09088;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;">获取模型</button></div></div>\n        <div><label style="font-size:11px;color:#706058;">模型列表</label><select id="foxmem-rerank-model-select" style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(232,120,74,.15);border-radius:6px;color:#e8ddd4;padding:6px 8px;"><option value="">（获取后选择）</option></select></div>\n        <div><label style="font-size:11px;color:#706058;">Rerank 权重（0-0.8）</label><input id="foxmem-rerank-weight" type="number" min="0" max="0.8" step="0.05" value="${o.rerank?.weight ?? 0.55}" style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(232,120,74,.15);border-radius:6px;color:#e8ddd4;padding:6px 8px;"></div>\n        <div><label style="font-size:11px;color:#706058;">最低重排分（0-1）</label><input id="foxmem-rerank-min-score" type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" value="${o.rerank?.minScore ?? 0.25}" style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(232,120,74,.15);border-radius:6px;color:#e8ddd4;padding:6px 8px;"></div>\n        <div><label style="font-size:11px;color:#706058;">候选池 Top N（5-200）</label><input id="foxmem-rerank-topn" type="number" min="5" max="200" step="5" value="${o.rerank?.topN ?? 30}" style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(232,120,74,.15);border-radius:6px;color:#e8ddd4;padding:6px 8px;"></div>\n        <div><label style="font-size:11px;color:#706058;">查询字数上限（0=不限制）</label><input id="foxmem-rerank-query-max-chars" type="number" min="0" max="20000" step="100" value="${o.rerank?.queryMaxChars ?? 0}" style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(232,120,74,.15);border-radius:6px;color:#e8ddd4;padding:6px 8px;"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;">\n        <button id="foxmem-rerank-test" type="button" style="flex:1;padding:7px;border:1px solid rgba(232,120,74,.25);border-radius:7px;background:rgba(232,120,74,.08);color:#f0a070;cursor:pointer;">测试连接</button>\n        <button id="foxmem-rerank-compare" type="button" style="padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid rgba(232,120,74,.25);border-radius:7px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);color:#a09088;cursor:pointer;">召回对比测试</button>\n      </div>\n      <div id="foxmem-rerank-stats" style="font-size:11px;color:#706058;line-height:1.6;margin-top:8px;white-space:pre-wrap;">${o.rerank?.enabled ? "已开启，保存配置后生效" : "当前关闭"}</div>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n    </div>\x3c!-- /pane api --\x3e\n\n      \x3c!-- ====== Tab5: 字段锁定 ====== --\x3e\n      <div class="fm-pane" data-pane="lock">\n        <div id="foxmem-lock-ui"></div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\x3c!-- /fm-main --\x3e\n    </div>\x3c!-- /fm-work --\x3e\n    <div class="fm-dock">\n      <div class="fm-dock-item cur" data-tab="mem"><div class="ic">📚</div><div class="lb">记忆库</div></div>\n      <div class="fm-dock-item" data-tab="gen"><div class="ic">🧠</div><div class="lb">生成</div></div>\n      <div class="fm-dock-item" data-tab="push"><div class="ic">🚀</div><div class="lb">推进</div></div>\n      <div class="fm-dock-item" data-tab="api"><div class="ic">🤖</div><div class="lb">配置</div></div>\n      <div class="fm-dock-item" data-tab="lock"><div class="ic">🔒</div><div class="lb">锁定</div></div>\n    </div>\n    `;
    R.body.appendChild(t);
